{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27946","headline":"自述 · 朱庆余","name":"自述","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诗人甘寂寞，居处遍苍苔。\n後夜蟾光满，邻家树影来。\n岂知莲帐好，自爱草堂开。\n愿答相思意，援毫愧不才。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"朱庆余","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27946.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27946","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}